      "name": "Oh, If Your Ancestors Could See You!",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Ferghaz holds other dwarves to an impossible standard, and his attacks carry the weight of a hundred generations' judgment. His Strikes deal an additional 1d4 mental damage to dwarves.",
